        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/67e7ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-10-12T21:20:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p>I was talking to a friend last night and he truly believes that Parse, Hunted Naturalist, and Grandpa Legacy are an unbeatable combination. Maybe he's right, maybe he's wrong I don't know. But it got me thinking...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What combination of characters is as close to unbeatable as you can get and&nbsp;Why? I'm looking for the cream of the crop, the baddest of the bad here.</p></blockquote><p><strong>EDIT: </strong>Ok, good point on the Dream Team thread, I'd forgotten about that. So a slight alteration...</p><p>Starting with a team of 4-5 random heroes explain how they could work together to be unbeatable. Perfectly stacked decks accepted.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:15.327Z",
