        "created_at": "2016-10-12T21:46:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For starters I'd suggest taking a look at his thread:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/dream-team-8874\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/dream-team-8874</a>&nbsp;where all purpose Dream teams were discussed, and people came up with some very interesting and powerful combinations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That was before the OblivAeon promo's though so here's a new one:</p><p><span>Freedom 5 Wraith,&nbsp;</span>Team Leader Tachyon, Captain Cosmic - Infinitor,&nbsp;<span>Completionist Guise, and Freedom 5 Legacy.</span></p>",
